<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Nuestro Paraguas — Production, under one umbrella</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #EFEBE2;
    --paper-2: #E6E0D3;
    --ink: #17171A;
    --ink-soft: #4A4844;
    --thread: #A33A2E;
    --thread-dark: #7C2C22;
    --tag: #C99A2E;
    --steel: #6B6862;
    --line: rgba(23,23,26,0.16);
    --radius: 3px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --paper: #1B1A17;
      --paper-2: #232019;
      --ink: #EFEBE2;
      --ink-soft: #C7C2B7;
      --thread: #E2665A;
      --thread-dark: #C4493E;
      --tag: #E3B94E;
      --steel: #9A9border;
      --steel: #9C978C;
      --line: rgba(239,235,226,0.16);
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --paper: #1B1A17;
    --paper-2: #232019;
    --ink: #EFEBE2;
    --ink-soft: #C7C2B7;
    --thread: #E2665A;
    --thread-dark: #C4493E;
    --tag: #E3B94E;
    --steel: #9C978C;
    --line: rgba(239,235,226,0.16);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, .display {
    font-family: 'Oswald', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(20px, 5vw, 56px);
  }

  /* Header */
  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
    z-index: 10;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 92%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .headbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 18px clamp(20px, 5vw, 56px);
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .mark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .mark img { height: 40px; width: auto; display: block; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .mark img, :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .hero-diagram img { filter: invert(1); } }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .mark img, :root[data-theme="dark"] .hero-diagram img { filter: invert(1); }
  .hero-diagram img { width: 100%; max-width: 240px; height: auto; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: clamp(14px, 3vw, 28px); font-size: 0.92rem; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--thread); }
  nav a:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--thread);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .nav-cta {
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 6px 14px !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper) !important; border-color: var(--ink); }

  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 108px) 0 clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.9fr;
    gap: clamp(28px, 6vw, 64px);
    align-items: end;
  }
  .eyebrow-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--steel);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .eyebrow-tag .dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--thread);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  h1.hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.1rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    max-width: 13ch;
  }
  .hero-title .accent { color: var(--thread); }
  .hero-sub {
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn-solid { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  .btn-solid:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-line { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-line:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }

  .hero-diagram { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; }
  .hero-diagram svg { width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; }

  /* Section shell */
  section { padding: clamp(52px, 9vw, 92px) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
  .section-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px); flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.2rem); }
  .section-note { color: var(--steel); font-size: 0.92rem; max-width: 32ch; }

  /* Roster / clients as a manifest list */
  .manifest { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .manifest-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.7fr 2fr;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .manifest-row .name { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .manifest-row .city { color: var(--thread); font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .manifest-row .note { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .manifest-row:hover { background: var(--paper-2); margin: 0 -16px; padding: 20px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius); }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .manifest-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
    .manifest-row:hover { margin: 0; padding: 20px 0; }
  }

  /* Process */
  .process-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .process-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 26px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .process-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .process-item .step-no {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    color: var(--thread);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .process-item h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .process-item p { color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; max-width: 60ch; }

  /* Contact / CTA */
  .cta-block {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: clamp(36px, 6vw, 60px);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 28px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cta-block h2 { color: var(--paper); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.1rem); max-width: 16ch; }
  .cta-block .btn-solid { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--paper); }
  .cta-block .btn-solid:hover { background: var(--thread); color: var(--paper); border-color: var(--thread); }

  footer { padding: 28px 0 calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); }
  .foot-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; color: var(--steel); font-size: 0.85rem; }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-diagram { order: -1; max-width: 160px; margin: 0 auto 8px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="headbar">
    <div class="mark">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Nuestro Paraguas">
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Start a project</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero wrap" style="border-left:none;border-right:none;">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow-tag"><span class="dot"></span>Manufacturing · design · print &amp; embroidery</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">One umbrella<br>over every stage <span class="accent">of the product.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Nuestro Paraguas takes a product from first sketch to finished goods — design and product development, vetted manufacturing partners, and local print for anything you need turned around close to home.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-solid">Start a project</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="services">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p class="section-note">Three ways in, depending on how far along the product already is.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="manifest">
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Manufacturing</div>
        <div class="city">China &amp; LA factories</div>
        <div class="note">Full garment production — cut-and-sew, knitwear, denim, and outerwear overseas, or small-batch Made-in-USA runs.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Blanks, print &amp; embroidery</div>
        <div class="city">US partners</div>
        <div class="note">Blanks sourced locally from whatever brand fits the job — Made Blanks, AS Colour, LA Apparel included — decorated through vetted print and embroidery partners.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Design &amp; product development</div>
        <div class="city">Tech packs &amp; size charts</div>
        <div class="note">Design creation, tech pack development, and size charts to get a product production-ready.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Project management &amp; logistics</div>
        <div class="city">Sampling to delivery</div>
        <div class="note">End-to-end oversight from sampling through QC, plus shipping and freight coordination.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="work">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Brands we've worked with</h2>
      <p class="section-note">Streetwear, restaurants, cannabis, music merch — any business that needs product made.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="manifest">
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Cash Register Crew</div>
        <div class="city">Los Angeles, CA</div>
        <div class="note">Streetwear brand — apparel production and product development.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Basic Respect</div>
        <div class="city">Australia</div>
        <div class="note">Apparel production and sourcing support.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">The Ramp</div>
        <div class="city">San Francisco, CA</div>
        <div class="note">Branded merch for the restaurant.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifest-row">
        <div class="name">Erba</div>
        <div class="city">Los Angeles, CA</div>
        <div class="note">Branded merch for the cannabis club.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="process">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>How a project runs</h2>
      <p class="section-note">Simple, in four stages, start to finish.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-list">
      <div class="process-item">
        <div class="step-no">01</div>
        <div><h3>Consult</h3><p>We talk through the product, the timeline, and the budget, and scope what production actually needs to look like.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-item">
        <div class="step-no">02</div>
        <div><h3>Match</h3><p>We connect you with vetted manufacturing partners suited to the product, quantity, and quality bar.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-item">
        <div class="step-no">03</div>
        <div><h3>Produce</h3><p>Samples, approvals, and the production run — we manage the back-and-forth with the factory.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-item">
        <div class="step-no">04</div>
        <div><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Finished goods land on your end, ready to sell.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="contact">
    <div class="cta-block">
      <h2>Have a product that needs a production partner?</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="mailto:hello@nuestroparaguas.com">Start a project</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="wrap">
  <div class="foot-row">
    <span>Nuestro Paraguas — design, manufacturing, and local print</span>
    <span>hello@nuestroparaguas.com · www.nuestroparaguas.com</span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
